@startuml kairos-log-follow-up-for-member-sequence
title Record Follow-Up Log for Member

actor "Follow-Up Worker" as Worker
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Worker -> WebAdmin: Open Member Detail\nGo to Follow-Up Log
Worker -> WebAdmin: Add new follow-up entry\n(notes, type, date)
WebAdmin -> API: POST /members/{id}/followups {entry}
API -> DB: INSERT FollowUp\n(member_id, created_by, type, notes, date)
DB --> API: New followupId
API --> WebAdmin: 201 Created

WebAdmin --> Worker: Append follow-up to log list

@enduml
